{"id":275690790611594,"type":"album","name":"No More Tears","artist":"Ozzy Osbourne","year":1991,"weight":12,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/18387-no-more-tears_035436.jpg","aoty":76,"aoty_user":82,"sputnik":3.91,"yt":"j-C8lIHJMak","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/ozzy-osbourne/no-more-tears","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/18387-ozzy-osbourne-no-more-tears.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/3525/Ozzy-Osbourne-No-More-Tears/"},"desc":"No More Tears is an album by Ozzy Osbourne. It was released on September 17, 1991 and it was re-issued on August 22, 1995. Guitarist Zakk Wylde contributed songwriting and guitar to the album, while Motörhead's bassist/vocalist Lemmy wrote the lyrics for four songs. Although Mike Inez is seen playing bass in several of the album's videos, long-time Ozzy bassist Bob Daisley plays on the entire album. Though Inez was an official member of the band, the Osbournes had a longstanding working relationship with Daisley and had also asked him to write lyrics, as he did for all of Ozzy's ."},"artist_ref":{"id":7079654414753,"name":"Ozzy Osbourne","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/OzzyChangingHands02-20-2010.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":185670346256268,"type":"genre","name":"rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3782,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":255263121494129,"type":"genre","name":"Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3474,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":174164112458259,"type":"genre","name":"Heavy Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":782,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":109063683126539,"type":"genre","name":"Hard Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":562,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":145763083606807,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Hard Rock","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":115,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":26388701878460